pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# Treasure Map add-on: turning pinyon_shift_dlc_treasure_map on in free roam
# runs the title's own Treasure Map reveal (sub_828AF6F8), as a purchase did.
# Before it the pause map shows only the found discount signs and offers
# RB BUY TREASURE MAP; after it the map shows every discount sign not yet
# found (pink dots) and the running barn find rumours' exact locations (tan
# barns), and the purchase is no longer offered. dlc.treasure_map logs the
# reveal with the activities revealed before and after.
# The setting is on by default, so the route turns it off first.
cvar 1 pinyon_shift_dlc_treasure_map false
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 255 0 0 0 0 0
capture 900 free-roam
input 930 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 960 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 966 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1050 map-before
input 1140 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1146 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
cvar 1180 pinyon_shift_dlc_treasure_map true
capture 1300 free-roam-owned
input 1330 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1336 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1420 map-owned
input 1480 0020 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
stop 1520
